DESCRIPTION:Presented in conjunction with Patty Chang's surfacing\, Tracin
 g What Remains: Memory\, Place\, and Chinese American Histories brings tog
 ether films that examine the histories of Chinese communities across North
 ern California through landscape\, memory\, and acts of remembrance. Movin
 g between documentary\, historical narrative\, and poetic reflection\, the
 se films trace the enduring presence of communities whose lives and labor 
 were systematically erased from the historical record.\n\nFrom the displac
 ed C\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://anderson.stanford.edu/exhibitions/
 patty-chang-surfacing/\nLast synced: 2026-11-14 10:40 PST
