SUMMARY:[Stanford] California Current: Art and Histories from the Bay Area
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTSTAMP:20261114T184029Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-54470477504285-54470477513508@local-events
DESCRIPTION:How does a community stay rooted in a region that’s constant
 ly changing? California Current invites you to consider this question and 
 others through its more than 60 works — many on view for the first time 
 — that explore the interplay between Bay Area history\, art\, and artist
 s over the past century.\n\nTitled after the major cold-water current that
  runs the length of the West Coast of North America\, California Current b
 rings together paintings\, sculptures\, works on paper\, photographs\, and
  time-bas\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-11-14 10:40 PST
END:VEVENT
