BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Stanford Humanities Center] "Looking for cousins": Affective reco
 gnition between Black migrants and Afro-Mexicans in Mexico’s "mestizo" s
 tate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T133000
DTSTAMP:20261114T184029Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-54472997883849-54472997884874@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The Global Studies in Migration and Diaspora Workshop will be 
 hosting Darlène Dubuisson\, an Assistant Professor in the Department of A
 frican American Studies at the University of California\, Berkeley. \n\nBu
 ilding upon Deborah Thomas’s “deep affective recognition\,” Dubuissi
