 . Joshua Landy. \n\nA New Linguistic and Political Regime\n\n“Women\,”
  “climate crisis\,” “disability\,” “diversity\,” “Black\,”
  “equality\,” “gender\,” “social justice\,” “LGBT\,” “pr
 ejudice\,” “racism\,” “vaccine” ... These words\, among many oth
 ers\, have been banned or blacklisted by the Trump administration\n\nAges:
  All ages\nLast synced: 2026-11-14 10:40 PST
LOCATION:Building 260\, Pigott Hall
END:VEVENT
